  # ############### SCRIPT uLM Factory ##################
  # *****************************************************
  # Customer          :   URG
  # Product Name      :   uLabMobile
  # ****************************************************
  # Controller/Robot  :   UR5e
  # Software          :   URSCRIPT
  # Dependencies      :   Defines Script but mainly independend
  # How To            :   is used by projectconfig to create list of structs full of projectrelated information which are used across the scripts
  # ****************************************************
  # Author            :   D.Kreugel
  # Copyright (c)     :   United Robotics Group Health and Food GmbH
  #                       An der Riede 2
  #                       28816 Stuhr
  #                       Germany
  # ****************************************************
  # Description       :   definition of the datastructures used by the uLM, gives functionality to create a predefined datastructure, is assigned to a global list in projectconfig
  # Version           :   0.2
  # Created           :   18.07.2024
  # Updated           :
